WEBVTT

00:27.720 --> 00:28.940
Well done, Shuu.

00:30.230 --> 00:32.900
To stand against experienced assassins without a single wound.

00:33.280 --> 00:35.160
I'm happy with your improvement.

00:35.160 --> 00:36.070
Father...

00:36.070 --> 00:37.680
You indeed are my son.

00:37.680 --> 00:40.060
All that's left for you is testing your skill in real battles.

00:41.500 --> 00:42.310
Shuu?

00:42.310 --> 00:44.320
I won't become an assassin.

00:44.320 --> 00:45.810
I'm going to become a chef.

00:45.810 --> 00:47.190
Chef?

00:48.230 --> 00:50.720
You're not planning on going to where she is, are you?

00:50.720 --> 00:52.210
Let's go, Tsubaki.

00:53.250 --> 00:54.370
Mother's waiting.

00:54.770 --> 00:55.720
Wait, Shuu!

00:56.060 --> 00:58.570
Even you... Even you are going to betray me?

00:58.570 --> 01:01.140
Shuu!

01:09.320 --> 01:11.210
Th-This can't be...

02:33.430 --> 02:35.210
80%?! You've got to be joking!

02:35.210 --> 02:37.010
My character setting is 100% complete!

02:37.010 --> 02:39.510
Pads? Those're nothing more than decoration to Kyouka-sama!

03:02.660 --> 03:04.580
Sign: Xie Xie Cafe

03:06.580 --> 03:08.750
Sign: Xie Xie Cafe

03:12.020 --> 03:13.370
Nii-sama...

03:13.370 --> 03:14.250
Shuu-kun.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.980
Hello, Chief of the neighborhood association.

03:16.980 --> 03:18.760
May I have a moment with you?

03:19.480 --> 03:20.970
Leave here?!

03:20.970 --> 03:22.710
W-Why are you saying that?

03:22.710 --> 03:25.170
That was the fifth one this month.

03:25.660 --> 03:28.910
I don't want to say this either, but...

03:29.270 --> 03:31.180
Have some tea.

03:31.740 --> 03:33.440
Ah, thank you.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.360
Hey, do you understand what I'm saying?

03:41.360 --> 03:42.610
Yes, I do.

03:42.610 --> 03:46.990
Then listen. Xie Xie Cafe doesn't have to be evicted.

03:46.990 --> 03:48.240
They don't have to be.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.910
Relay the message to the others, too.

03:49.910 --> 03:52.120
Yes, I will let the others know, too.

03:52.120 --> 03:53.750
Good. You may leave now.

03:58.570 --> 04:00.110
That takes care of that.

04:00.110 --> 04:01.840
No, it doesn't!

04:01.840 --> 04:04.220
Oh, what's the problem, Nii-sama?

04:04.220 --> 04:08.570
"What's the problem?" I told you many times not to use poisons.

04:08.570 --> 04:11.080
Tsubaki, we're no longer assassins.

04:11.080 --> 04:13.980
We have to become a normal Chinese restaurant.

04:14.720 --> 04:16.770
Another person collapsed, though.

04:17.690 --> 04:21.190
I wonder why anyone who eats anything you cook-

04:20.640 --> 04:22.200
I didn't try to kill anyone!

04:26.780 --> 04:28.240
Why?

04:28.240 --> 04:31.030
I'm only cooking as Mother's recipes instruct.

04:31.540 --> 04:33.620
That's an easy question, Shuu.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.370
There!

04:37.790 --> 04:40.220
Looks like you're as good as you ever were.

04:41.060 --> 04:42.680
Could it be you, Father?

04:42.680 --> 04:44.220
Yes.

04:44.220 --> 04:46.270
Long time no see, Father.

04:46.270 --> 04:47.550
I'm happy to see you.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.350
Oh yeah, would you like something to eat?

04:49.790 --> 04:52.560
The marinated pork I've been working on since this morning should be just about ready.

04:51.590 --> 04:55.690
I'm sorry, but I have no intention of
ingesting food that makes you collapse.

04:56.250 --> 04:58.440
You are my son, after all.

04:58.440 --> 05:02.180
Even after becoming a chef,
your body kills others without thinking.

05:02.180 --> 05:02.860
That's not true!

05:02.860 --> 05:04.360
Accept it, Shuu.

05:04.360 --> 05:06.970
You're an assassin that can live only in the darkness.

05:06.970 --> 05:07.870
No!

05:08.250 --> 05:12.150
Then why do those who eat your dishes collapse one after another?

05:12.150 --> 05:13.290
That's because...

05:13.290 --> 05:15.880
Soon, you will return.

05:15.880 --> 05:17.580
Return to me.

05:26.960 --> 05:35.060
Those are the recipes I wrote hoping you, Tsubaki, and your father will have a happy life.

05:35.930 --> 05:38.530
I originally meant to give them to your father.

05:38.880 --> 05:40.880
But I'm sure he won't take them.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.320
That's not true! Father will-

05:44.320 --> 05:47.750
After all, he hates me.

05:48.820 --> 05:49.570
Mother?

05:49.570 --> 05:51.300
Don't forget, Shuu.

05:51.300 --> 05:52.660
Chinese is invincible.

05:52.660 --> 05:54.380
Chinese is the strongest.

05:54.380 --> 05:58.260
May the world and the family be at peace through Chinese food.

05:58.260 --> 05:59.260
Mother?

05:59.260 --> 06:01.200
Don't go! Mother!

06:02.330 --> 06:06.400
May the world and the family be at peace through Chinese food, eh?

06:06.810 --> 06:08.880
I don't understand it, Mother.

06:08.880 --> 06:11.010
What are you doing, Nii-sama?

06:11.500 --> 06:12.410
Tsubaki!

06:12.740 --> 06:13.640
What's wrong?

06:15.750 --> 06:19.900
You want to live the life of a chef, not of an assassin, right?

06:19.900 --> 06:21.170
Of course.

06:21.170 --> 06:24.980
I want to cook Chinese dishes that will make anyone who eats them smile.

06:25.650 --> 06:27.740
I'm glad to hear that.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.740
Hey, Tsubaki?

06:34.320 --> 06:35.740
Hey, Yuuka!

06:36.150 --> 06:38.910
Y-Ya-Yamada-kun.

06:38.910 --> 06:40.170
I'm Yamaguchi.

06:40.170 --> 06:41.330
Yamaguchi Kiyoshi.

06:43.060 --> 06:44.340
I'm sorry.

06:46.240 --> 06:48.420
It's fine; it's just a name.

06:48.420 --> 06:50.620
Hey, w-wanna walk home together?

06:51.230 --> 06:52.650
Sure.

06:52.650 --> 06:53.850
R-Really?

06:53.850 --> 06:54.920
Hold on.

06:56.160 --> 06:57.210
Tsubaki...

06:57.210 --> 06:59.350
Yuuka-chan, let's go home together.

06:59.350 --> 07:01.010
Um, Ryukotsuji-san?

07:01.010 --> 07:03.260
Hey Tsubaki, I asked her first!

07:03.260 --> 07:04.980
Besides, you're in a different class!

07:06.820 --> 07:08.640
Don't touch me without permission, brat.

07:08.640 --> 07:10.450
I'll poison you with a toxin that'd make you dumber than a monkey.

07:13.020 --> 07:14.200
Yamamoto-kun!

07:15.150 --> 07:16.520
Let's go now.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.960
Um... Um... Ryukotsuji-san?

07:25.010 --> 07:28.260
Are your lion and robot brothers doing well?

07:30.040 --> 07:30.470
Th-That's!

07:30.470 --> 07:34.170
I researched a little, and you seem to have a very interesting family.

07:35.340 --> 07:37.450
Ryukotsuji-san, could you keep this a-

07:37.450 --> 07:38.780
I won't tell anyone.

07:39.520 --> 07:40.930
But in return...

07:43.180 --> 07:46.770
Please help Nii-sama... Help our store.

07:47.730 --> 07:49.280
Ryukotsuji-san?

07:58.970 --> 08:00.460
Accept it, Shuu.

08:00.460 --> 08:03.830
You're an assassin that can live only in the darkness.

08:03.830 --> 08:05.450
No, I'm a....

08:05.840 --> 08:07.040
Nii-sama...

08:07.040 --> 08:08.170
Hello!

08:08.170 --> 08:09.840
Hello!!!

08:12.060 --> 08:13.030
I win.

08:13.590 --> 08:14.180
Hey!

08:14.180 --> 08:15.880
What was that for, Ouka!

08:15.880 --> 08:18.480
Can't you enter more normally?

08:18.480 --> 08:20.800
How could you expect anything normal from Kyouka-sama's entrance!

08:20.800 --> 08:23.190
In fact, I'd rather see an explosion!

08:23.190 --> 08:26.970
It's because you make entrances like that
that you get banned from one place after another.

08:26.970 --> 08:28.080
It hurts.

08:28.490 --> 08:32.040
Sorry, we look strange, but we are here to eat.

08:32.040 --> 08:33.860
Then please take a seat.

08:34.360 --> 08:36.160
Oh, my group isn't here yet.

08:36.160 --> 08:38.280
Come on in, everyone.

08:41.330 --> 08:42.580
There's eight of us.

08:43.830 --> 08:47.960
But you have a lion, jellyfish, a biological weapon,
and me, Kyouka-sama, a god!

08:50.460 --> 08:51.460
Your orders?

08:51.460 --> 08:52.960
Hamburger.

08:53.490 --> 08:54.810
Beef bowl with extra sauce!

08:54.810 --> 08:55.930
Raw meat, please.

08:59.350 --> 09:02.350
May I have the kids meal?

09:02.350 --> 09:05.500
Could you order something on the menu, please?

09:05.500 --> 09:07.990
Fool! And you call yourself a chef?!

09:07.990 --> 09:12.000
It's absurd of you to be bound by a menu and constrain your true ability!

09:12.000 --> 09:14.860
Anyway, we'll leave it to you, Ryukotsuji Shuu-kun.

09:14.860 --> 09:16.490
Why do you know my name?

09:16.490 --> 09:18.850
I heard the situation you're in.

09:18.850 --> 09:22.290
My daughter and your sister go to the same school.

09:22.720 --> 09:23.370
Um...

09:23.370 --> 09:26.030
Anyone who eats your food dies, right?

09:26.460 --> 09:29.400
Your sister explained it all.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.330
Tsubaki?

09:33.750 --> 09:34.890
Tsubaki...

09:34.890 --> 09:37.360
You don't have to worry about anything.

09:37.950 --> 09:42.350
They will prove that you're not an assassination chef.

09:42.760 --> 09:43.720
So...

09:48.440 --> 09:51.770
Our restaurant's top menu, Wong Zhu Zhu Xie Yui.

09:52.420 --> 09:54.070
Please enjoy while it's hot.

09:54.070 --> 09:55.960
That's a good face you have.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.730
You look like a different person from a moment ago.

09:57.730 --> 09:59.320
I shall trust that expression of yours.

09:59.320 --> 10:02.070
Midarezaki family, charge!

10:02.070 --> 10:03.830
We are starting our party for tonight!

10:03.830 --> 10:07.000
The goal is to clear the Xie Xie Cafe's
charge of assassination.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.670
The reason is because it sounds fun and to help Yuuka's friend.

10:10.670 --> 10:15.790
Also, we've been banned from everywhere else, so if this place goes, there won't be anything left in the shopping district.

10:15.790 --> 10:18.540
You're mostly the reason, just so you know.

10:18.540 --> 10:20.550
Everyone, dig in!

10:20.550 --> 10:22.810
Itadakimasu.

10:25.460 --> 10:27.230
Hey, why won't anyone eat?

10:27.230 --> 10:28.650
Y-You go first, Kitty.

10:28.650 --> 10:30.910
At times like this, Mother should go first.

10:30.910 --> 10:33.060
I think that's the best choice, too.

10:36.210 --> 10:37.740
Ouka, you eat first.

10:37.740 --> 10:39.490
No, you go ahead, Kyouka.

10:39.490 --> 10:40.840
Don't be so modest about it, Darling.

10:40.840 --> 10:43.770
At times like this, the father,
master of the house should be eating first.

10:43.770 --> 10:46.820
Don't highlight the male chauvinist idea only at times like this, Honey.

10:46.820 --> 10:49.660
If you're a man, eat a poison or two with a smile.

10:49.660 --> 10:52.690
You, too! You're so tough, a poison or two won't kill you.

10:52.690 --> 10:55.100
We're not trusted at all.

10:55.670 --> 10:57.710
Then I'll eat.

10:59.180 --> 11:01.690
How is it? Is it all right, Hyouka-chan?

11:01.690 --> 11:03.710
It's not poisonous.

11:03.710 --> 11:07.310
If no one's going to eat it, I'll eat it all.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.310
It tastes good.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.300
No, you don't!

11:08.310 --> 11:10.560
Give it back, Mother.

11:09.050 --> 11:10.320
Not fair!

11:11.400 --> 11:12.770
You thought you could win against me?

11:14.310 --> 11:15.270
What's the matter?

11:15.800 --> 11:16.580
Kyouka?

11:18.100 --> 11:19.340
It's hot.

11:21.030 --> 11:24.030
I'm not good with hot foods.

11:24.030 --> 11:27.180
Okay. Next time, make sure you blow on it before you eat it.

11:30.170 --> 11:32.170
Well done! It's really good!

11:32.170 --> 11:36.340
I like Pierre's cooking, but this is better by a league or two.

11:36.340 --> 11:38.640
Yes, it really is good.

11:37.920 --> 11:39.630
I did it, Tsubaki!

11:39.630 --> 11:41.510
No one's collapsing! And they're giving compliments!

11:41.510 --> 11:44.620
That's right. I'm not an assassination chef.

11:44.620 --> 11:46.760
What happened in the past must all be some kind of mistake.

11:47.560 --> 11:48.430
Chika-chan!

11:48.430 --> 11:49.230
Nee-sama!

11:49.230 --> 11:50.770
Wake up, Nee-sama!

11:51.320 --> 11:52.980
What? Again?

11:52.980 --> 11:54.310
How dare you take Chika away.

11:54.930 --> 11:56.460
Hyouka! Teika! Gekka!

11:57.320 --> 11:58.980
It's not me. I didn't kill her.

11:58.980 --> 11:59.480
Shut up!

12:01.420 --> 12:04.030
So you've shown your true face, assassination chef.

12:04.030 --> 12:05.040
No!

12:05.040 --> 12:07.220
Nii-sama is not an assassination chef!

12:07.220 --> 12:10.910
It's true that we were raised to become assassins from the moment we were born.

12:10.910 --> 12:15.170
But Nii-sama said that he wants to make everyone smile with Chinese food.

12:15.840 --> 12:17.820
Tsubaki, it's all right now.

12:17.820 --> 12:19.330
Nii-sama...

12:19.330 --> 12:20.670
It's all right now.

12:20.670 --> 12:22.390
I'm sorry, Mother.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.300
Wait.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.390
Hold on, everyone.

12:25.930 --> 12:27.320
Chika, you're alive!

12:27.320 --> 12:28.860
Don't go killing me like that.

12:30.390 --> 12:32.280
I'm sorry for you.

12:38.270 --> 12:40.110
It's spicy. But it's good.

12:41.560 --> 12:45.540
I know the reason why people collapse after eating your food.

12:53.460 --> 12:55.330
What are you cooking?

12:55.750 --> 12:59.120
This is the sauce for the sesame balls.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.100
Sauce?

13:00.100 --> 13:02.540
Yup. It's your father's favorite food.

13:02.540 --> 13:05.910
Yeah... Mother was always making that for Father.

13:05.910 --> 13:07.220
Okay, it's ready.

13:10.930 --> 13:12.010
We not going to eat it?

13:12.010 --> 13:16.650
Sesame ball sauce tastes better when it's cooled.

13:17.250 --> 13:21.640
Yeah, there always was some sauce
in the refrigerator, wasn't there?

13:22.090 --> 13:24.740
Wait, but in Mother's recipe book...

13:27.700 --> 13:31.930
Just as I thought. The recipe for
the sesame ball sauce isn't in here.

13:31.930 --> 13:32.890
Why?

13:32.890 --> 13:34.020
Nii-sama.

13:34.370 --> 13:35.930
What is it, Tsubaki?

13:35.930 --> 13:38.880
Yuuka-chan's mother is calling for you.

13:41.490 --> 13:43.510
Are you ready for this, Ryukotsuji Shuu?

13:43.510 --> 13:45.030
Um, what is this?

13:45.030 --> 13:49.010
Don't ask the obvious. When you go training,
it's obviously done at a temple or in the mountains.

13:51.010 --> 13:51.930
Three days.

13:52.890 --> 13:54.810
We will whip you back into shape in three days.

13:54.810 --> 13:56.310
In such a short period of time?

13:56.310 --> 14:01.310
If you pass all the criteria I put before you, then no one shall collapse from your food.

14:02.040 --> 14:02.940
Really?

14:02.940 --> 14:04.040
Leave it to me.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.730
As a most wonderful fact, I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

14:06.730 --> 14:07.510
Um, Kyouka.

14:08.110 --> 14:08.990
What is it?

14:08.990 --> 14:11.570
How long should we be here?

14:11.570 --> 14:13.740
More to the point, what's the meaning to this?

14:17.370 --> 14:18.130
What are these?

14:18.130 --> 14:19.640
Weights where each one weighs 10kg.

14:19.640 --> 14:21.230
Make something with those on.

14:21.230 --> 14:22.070
Okay.

14:22.210 --> 14:23.510
Here it is.

14:23.510 --> 14:24.880
Wang Yao Shou.

14:24.880 --> 14:27.730
It looks murderously good as always.

14:30.390 --> 14:32.000
Help me!

14:32.000 --> 14:33.160
Chief of the neighborhood association?

14:33.160 --> 14:37.430
The one to test it on has to be some average human like him.

14:37.430 --> 14:38.350
Therefore,

14:38.350 --> 14:41.350
you shall take it as an honor to be fed by me.

14:38.350 --> 14:39.690
Forgive me...

14:39.690 --> 14:44.650
I have a wife, three daughters, an old mother, and a mortgage on my house left.

14:41.350 --> 14:44.270
PLACEHOLDER

14:44.270 --> 14:47.360
I don't care about your life. Quit talking and eat!

14:53.090 --> 14:55.740
It's good! It's great! It's delicious!

14:55.740 --> 14:59.490
It's exquisite!

15:03.470 --> 15:04.800
Chief?

15:13.380 --> 15:15.840
I guess that wasn't enough.

15:15.840 --> 15:18.830
Kyouka-san, we already have a victim!

15:18.830 --> 15:20.680
Don't worry. I have replacements ready.

15:20.680 --> 15:22.420
That's not the point!

15:21.740 --> 15:24.230
Let's increase the weights by three times next, shall we?

15:27.440 --> 15:29.740
I guess it's still not enough.

15:30.430 --> 15:31.870
I'm sorry, everyone.

15:31.870 --> 15:33.420
I'm really sorry.

15:32.410 --> 15:33.420
That's it for today.

15:33.420 --> 15:34.410
We'll continue tomorrow.

15:38.390 --> 15:41.910
It's restraining equipment the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures made for monsters.

15:41.910 --> 15:43.460
Press this button and...

15:44.200 --> 15:47.260
Now your physical capability should be heavily restricted.

15:47.260 --> 15:48.890
More like I can't move.

15:48.890 --> 15:50.720
Maybe it's too tight.

15:51.730 --> 15:54.050
I'll break in half.

15:52.060 --> 15:53.050
Oops, wrong one.

15:54.770 --> 15:55.900
I thought I was going to die.

15:55.900 --> 15:57.590
Well then, let's prepare to open the store.

15:57.590 --> 15:58.330
Open?

15:58.330 --> 15:59.560
Hello.

15:59.560 --> 16:01.320
Ah, so you're here, Pierre.

16:01.320 --> 16:05.360
If it's an invitation from you, I, Nishikura, will go anywhere.

16:05.360 --> 16:07.000
Did you bring them with you?

16:07.000 --> 16:08.370
Of course.

16:08.370 --> 16:09.370
Everyone!

16:12.090 --> 16:13.200
M-Monkeys?

16:13.200 --> 16:15.630
Be happy. I reserved the entire place for them.

16:16.740 --> 16:19.710
I'm a biological weapon, but will you let me eat here?

16:20.410 --> 16:24.390
Is this the restaurant that will even let animals eat?

16:24.830 --> 16:27.010
Fight through the entire day.

16:27.010 --> 16:28.340
That's your second day's training menu.

16:34.580 --> 16:36.970
Three tang tang ramen for Table 5.

16:37.460 --> 16:39.860
Three tang tang ramen, right away.

16:40.640 --> 16:42.990
Kan Xiao Shuu Shi's ready.

16:42.990 --> 16:43.820
Okay.

16:44.230 --> 16:45.960
You look happy.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.520
D-Do I?

16:47.520 --> 16:49.790
Yup. The smile on your face isn't going away.

16:49.790 --> 16:52.530
I guess. I'm having a great time right now.

16:52.530 --> 16:56.350
So many customers are eating the Chinese dishes I made.

16:56.350 --> 16:58.640
Humans and even those who are not.

16:58.640 --> 17:00.740
Before of Chinese food, they're all equal.

17:01.190 --> 17:02.580
Chinese is invincible.

17:02.580 --> 17:03.960
Chinese is the strongest.

17:03.960 --> 17:07.110
May the world and the family be at peace through Chinese food.

17:07.700 --> 17:10.210
I see. So that's what you meant.

17:16.750 --> 17:18.070
Closing already?

17:19.190 --> 17:21.480
Then I guess I'll have to come some other time.

17:21.780 --> 17:22.500
Wait.

17:23.510 --> 17:25.330
Hours of operation don't matter.

17:25.980 --> 17:28.360
You can eat here anytime you want.

17:28.870 --> 17:29.900
Why?

17:30.390 --> 17:31.860
Because we're family,

17:32.350 --> 17:33.070
Father.

17:37.610 --> 17:40.490
Hey Father, why did you divorce Mother?

17:40.490 --> 17:42.120
Tell us, Father.

17:42.120 --> 17:46.710
She was... Harukaze was only after my body.

17:47.520 --> 17:48.210
Huh?

17:48.840 --> 17:50.250
Harukaze was a genius.

17:50.780 --> 17:54.630
People all around the world came to eat her food.

17:54.630 --> 17:57.470
Countless restaurants wanted her over.

17:57.470 --> 18:01.680
However, Harukaze had a fatal flaw as a chef.

18:01.680 --> 18:03.510
Fatal flaw?

18:03.510 --> 18:07.640
She was physically ill, so she couldn't stand in the kitchen for many hours.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.960
The tools for making Chinese food are all very heavy.

18:09.960 --> 18:13.230
Making intricate food requires a great amount of strength.

18:13.230 --> 18:14.230
In other words!

18:14.230 --> 18:17.810
Harukaze was after my great strength!

18:18.120 --> 18:21.740
She told me time after time to quit being an assassin.

18:21.740 --> 18:26.420
Of course she would, since it's an important body that makes the Chinese dishes in place of her!

18:26.420 --> 18:27.500
No love exists in a-

18:28.530 --> 18:29.430
What was that-

18:30.510 --> 18:32.670
W-Wait. Tsubaki.

18:32.670 --> 18:37.600
It's obvious she wanted the one dearest to her to quit a dangerous job like being an assassin!

18:37.600 --> 18:38.550
You idiot!

18:38.550 --> 18:40.250
Who are you calling an idiot?

18:40.250 --> 18:41.150
You guys don't understand anything.

18:41.150 --> 18:44.720
What's wrong with calling an idiot an idiot, you absolute dope!

18:44.720 --> 18:45.670
This voice is...

18:47.230 --> 18:49.130
What? Why are you here?

18:49.130 --> 18:52.530
Nothing much. I just remembered I forgot to tell you something.

18:52.530 --> 18:54.110
More importantly, look at this.

18:56.060 --> 18:57.360
Th-That's...

18:57.360 --> 18:58.860
Just read it.

19:00.710 --> 19:03.240
Wh-What is this embarrassing thing?

19:03.240 --> 19:05.330
That's Mother's recipe book.

19:06.100 --> 19:07.210
Harukaze's?

19:07.210 --> 19:11.790
You think someone who's only after you for your body could write something as ridiculous as that?

19:11.790 --> 19:14.500
For your information, I wouldn't do it even if paid!

19:15.040 --> 19:17.340
This doesn't mean anything.

19:17.340 --> 19:20.210
Men are all idiots.

19:20.210 --> 19:23.590
Those recipes were written for you.

19:23.590 --> 19:24.490
What?

19:24.490 --> 19:25.850
Change of plans.

19:25.850 --> 19:27.100
Ryukotsuji Shuu.

19:27.470 --> 19:29.770
I give you your last trial.

19:30.200 --> 19:32.420
A dish that will awaken your Father's mind.

19:32.420 --> 19:34.250
That's the last menu.

19:34.250 --> 19:35.450
It has to be that.

19:35.450 --> 19:36.360
Right?

19:40.520 --> 19:41.700
Here it is.

19:43.140 --> 19:43.950
This is...

19:44.760 --> 19:46.380
Sesame ball sauce.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.230
Your favorite dish.

19:48.660 --> 19:50.100
Why did you choose that?

19:50.520 --> 19:54.290
Because this is the one thing not in Mother's recipe book.

19:55.000 --> 19:57.820
I think it's as you said, Kyouka-san.

19:57.820 --> 20:02.300
What's written in here are all dishes meant for Father to make.

20:02.870 --> 20:05.380
However, the sesame ball sauce wasn't.

20:05.910 --> 20:09.560
This is something Mother wanted to cook for you.

20:10.280 --> 20:11.560
For me...

20:11.560 --> 20:16.560
One more thing. Those dishes are the reason why this place started to be called the "assassination restaurant".

20:17.060 --> 20:24.010
Harukaze probably didn't expect it herself, but cooking according to the recipes makes the food taste too good.

20:24.530 --> 20:28.610
It's so good that average humans can't stand it so they fall unconscious.

20:29.850 --> 20:31.500
You've seen the hints of it, right?

20:32.500 --> 20:35.790
Oh yeah, everyone who collapsed were ordinary people.

20:36.190 --> 20:38.420
Then what happened in the past two days was...

20:38.420 --> 20:42.990
I was trying to tire you out and reduce you to average level, since you're tougher than everyone.

20:44.690 --> 20:46.340
You're unbelievable, Mother.

20:48.470 --> 20:49.510
Wait!

20:49.890 --> 20:51.880
Those recipes belong to you two.

20:52.220 --> 20:53.850
I don't have the right to take them.

20:54.580 --> 20:56.090
What are you going to do now?

20:56.090 --> 20:59.740
Well, I'll find a new way of living.

21:00.250 --> 21:02.380
I'm closing down my assassination practice.

21:02.380 --> 21:03.360
Father!

21:03.750 --> 21:05.610
We'll meet again, Shuu, Tsubaki!

21:05.610 --> 21:06.360
Yeah, Father.

21:06.360 --> 21:08.330
See you again, Father.

21:08.330 --> 21:13.520
Oh yeah, the sesame ball sauce. It tastes better if it's cold.

21:14.000 --> 21:16.470
I'll serve it cold next time.

21:23.560 --> 21:24.790
Welcome!

21:27.280 --> 21:28.800
Hello, Shuu-kun.

21:28.800 --> 21:30.730
Chief of the neighborhood association.

21:30.730 --> 21:32.700
Looks like it's busy in here.

21:32.700 --> 21:33.790
Yes, thank you.

21:33.790 --> 21:34.740
Seconds!

21:35.230 --> 21:37.670
Hey owner, bring me my seconds!

21:37.670 --> 21:38.560
Yes, right away.

21:38.560 --> 21:40.430
Don't try to hide anything from me.

21:40.430 --> 21:43.070
After all, I, Kyouka-sama am this restaurant's savior.

21:42.320 --> 21:43.070
Itadakimasu.

21:43.070 --> 21:46.700
Hyouka! How dare you snatch food off of my plate!

21:47.400 --> 21:48.580
Even you, Gekka?!

21:49.010 --> 21:51.180
I take it you guys don't care for your lives!

21:49.440 --> 21:50.570
Nii-sama.

21:50.570 --> 21:53.240
Shouldn't you charge them after all?

21:57.050 --> 21:58.550
Chinese is invincible.

21:58.550 --> 22:00.140
Chinese is the strongest.

22:00.140 --> 22:03.690
May the world and the family be at peace through Chinese food.

22:06.160 --> 22:07.530
Come on in!

22:07.530 --> 22:09.010
Welcome to Xie Xie Cafe!

23:40.520 --> 23:42.230
Mom! Mom!

23:42.230 --> 23:43.910
We simply have a problem!

23:43.910 --> 23:49.400
Dad's... Dad's... with a woman we've never met before.

23:50.080 --> 23:53.200
Next time: How to Make a Kind Grim Reaper.
